  {
   "id": "slime-3k-rise-against-despot-244377@1.2",
   "gameId": "slime-3k-rise-against-despot-244377",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 1.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-13T17:05:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "38 New Achievements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "First off, we added some fun trophies we thought would be cool: clearing a level without taking damage, surviving five minutes in survival mode, and so on. Second, there’s now an achievement for every unlockable upgrade—whether it’s something you buy with DNA points or a new starting trait set for Slime. We also figured Steam’s achievement system is a great way to let players know they’ve unlocked something fresh in-game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "A new DNA upgrade",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Not This Time: Upon taking lethal damage, Slime briefly gains invincibility. One more clutch upgrade to help you scrape through a tough level at the last moment.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hope you dig the upgrade's icon.👇 I mean, it's called \"Not This Time,\" so...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Other Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Revamped UI sounds. Hopefully, you’ll love the way menus click and clack now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added camera shake for certain events. But hey, no worries—there’s a toggle in the settings if shaking ain’t your thing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reworked the settings menu and added credits with names of puny humans from the dev and publishing teams.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since you've been asking, we've made tag filters pop more visually in the deck builder.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a ton of slimy little bugs. Hopefully, we didn’t add new ones in the process! Feel free to report any issues you come across here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have fun!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "By the way, all our games are on sale until March 20th",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🧪Despotism 3k—where the whole Despot thing started",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🤖Despot's Game (& DLC)—the Despot has the remnants of the human race under control",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "☣️Slime 3K—a pile of sentient green goo has suddenly risen against the Despot",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Check out the whole catalog here",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Konfa Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
